    "directions": [
      "Take fish fillets and apply salt and turmeric and marinate well. Keep for 10 minutes.",
      "Now, heat oil in the pan and cook the fish from both sides, 3 mins on each side. Remove the fish from the pan and keep aside for later use.",
      "In the same pan, Add curry leaves, sliced onions and saute for 2 minutes.",
      "Now, add in all the spices and mix well. Add drumstick, water and simmer for 12-15 minutes.",
      "Add in coconut milk. Season with salt. Add tamarind paste, jaggery and mix well.",
      "Transfer fish and cook for 2 minutes more. Turn off the flame."
    ],
